    "title": "Tom Arnold Coming to Empire Comedy Club in Portland - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeff Parsons ,\n13 hours ago Actor and comedian Tom Arnold is best known for playing Arnie Thomas on the sitcom Roseanne , which starred his ex-wife Roseanne Barr. Now he is coming to Portland for a show at Empire Comedy Club.\nTom Arnold’s Career Comedy Dynamics via YouTube In the early 1980s, according to Wikipedia , Tom Arnold had a prop-based comedy routine called “Tom Arnold and the Goldfish Review.” Roseanne Barr must have seen his routine and brought him in as a writer for Roseanne . The two eventually married in 1990, and Tom wrote himself into the show as “Arnie Thomas.” Get it?\nHe’s also been in a ton of movies, including True Lies, McHale’s Navy, Mr. 3000, The Great Buck Howard (2008), and appeared on the popular FX series Sons of Anarchy .\nHere’s the famous ex-couples’ appearance on The Arsineo Hall Show.\nSubscribe to Big Country 96.9 on Youtube\nTom Arnold coming to Empire Comedy Club in Portland Tom Arnold is currently on tour with over 50stops across the country, and one of them will be right here in Maine at the Empire Comedy Club in Portland on Sunday, November 16.\nSubscribe to Big Country 96.9 on Youtube\nHe is currently in Arnold Schwarzenegger’s new Netlflix series FUBAR and just finished directing his first feature film.\nThis is the part that makes you go, “Really?” Tom has a 12-year-old son, a 9-year-old daughter, and 4 ex-wives. He’s been stabbed, arrested naked, and charged for kidnapping a Peter Criss impersonator.” Wow! No wonder he’s single.\nHis current stand-up comedy tour, called ‘My Crazy X-Wife’, is named appropriately.\nREAD MORE: Bobcat Goldthwait Brings His Wild Humor to Portland, Maine\nIf you want tickers to see Tom Arnold, grab them while you can online at Empire Comedy Club’s website.\nNovember 16th in Portland, ME!Tom Arnold is an actor, writer, and comedian with a career spanning over forty years,…\nPosted by on\nEmpire Comedy Club is located at 575 Congress St, 2nd floor, in Portland.\nClick here to view photo gallery Click here to view photo gallery\nSource: Tom Arnold Coming to Empire Comedy Club in Portland",
